 - [docs/adr/0012-uncertainty-envelope-ir-contract.md](../../../../docs/adr/0012-uncertainty-envelope-ir-contract.md)
 - [docs/adr/0013-uncertainty-propagation-pipeline.md](../../../../docs/adr/0013-uncertainty-propagation-pipeline.md)
